Z||000003||Cooter||03-14-2000||09:25 PM||||At work, I was called out to jump off a dead Blazer in the schools driveway. As I pulled the Fiero around and hooked up the cables, the truck's owner said, "Aren't you afraid that thang's gonna catch on fire?"<BR>I replied, "Aint you afraid your truck wont crank? At least mine is running right now."<BR>Some people are just wasting my oxygen by standing too close.||||reg||1
Z||000004||87SC/GT||03-14-2000||10:29 PM||||That's where I would have had to say..."Gee that's too bad. The 82 V-8 model is the most sought after Fiero ever produced. Out of the seven produced, only two are know to still exist. One sold recently for 1.5 million and the other...we'll....I wouldn't sell it for ten million."||||reg||1
