Z||000006||Oreif||03-15-2000||11:38 AM||||I went to buy strut dust boots the other day and told the guy it was an 86 Fiero. He punched feverishly on his computer terminal and he came back and asked if I was sure it was an 86. I told him yes and he said Buick doesn't list an 86 fiero! Once I told him it was a Pontiac he was able to get me the parts!||||reg||1
