Z||000009||wkayl||03-15-2000||08:51 PM||||A year ago I overhauled my son's 84SE.  I went to Auto Zone to get the crank.  The guy said he always liked them and wished he had one.  5 months later I got my 86GT.  When I pulled up in front of the store with it, his jaw almost hit the floor.  Guess where I get most of my parts from?<P>The guy at the mailbox store that I get mail from for my job said that the Fiero is a mechanics nightmare.  This from a guy that has trouble changing stations on his radio.  ||||reg||1
